{
  "id": "doorway-effect",
  "format": "short",
  "title": "Why You Forget Things When You Walk Into a Room",
  "tone": "relatable",
  "sources": [
    "Radvansky, Krawietz & Tamplin (2011). Walking through doorways causes forgetting. Quarterly Journal of Experimental Psychology, 64(8)",
    "Radvansky & Copeland (2006). Walking through doorways causes forgetting: situation models and experienced space. Memory & Cognition, 34(5)"
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "say": "Have you ever walked into a room... and *completely* forgotten why?",
      "visual": {
        "type": "situation",
        "setting": "room",
        "props": [
          {
            "type": "door",
            "x": 0.2
          },
          {
            "type": "plant",
            "x": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "people": [
          {
            "x": 0.6,
            "walk": {
              "from": 0.2,
              "seconds": 1.3
            },
            "face": "neutral",
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "forgotten",
                "pose": "scratch",
                "face": "confused"
              }
            ],
            "emote": "?",
            "emoteAt": "why"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fridge",
      "say": "And now you're just staring at the fridge like it owes you money.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "situation",
        "setting": "room",
        "props": [
          {
            "type": "fridge",
            "x": 0.74
          }
        ],
        "people": [
          {
            "x": 0.32,
            "pose": "cross",
            "face": "meh",
            "gaze": 0.9,
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "owes",
                "pose": "hips",
                "face": "annoyed"
              }
            ],
            "emote": "...",
            "emoteAt": "staring"
          }
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "kind": "arrow",
            "target": "prop:0",
            "at": "money",
            "label": "owes me $20"
          }
        ],
        "camera": {
          "zoom": [
            1,
            1.08
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "door",
      "say": "It's not your memory. It's the *door.*",
      "visual": {
        "type": "situation",
        "setting": "room",
        "props": [
          {
            "type": "door",
            "x": 0.36,
            "scale": 1
          }
        ],
        "people": [
          {
            "x": 0.78,
            "pose": "stand",
            "face": "smug",
            "gaze": -0.8,
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "door",
                "pose": "point",
                "face": "grin"
              }
            ],
            "flip": true
          }
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "kind": "circle",
            "target": "prop:0",
            "at": "door"
          }
        ],
        "camera": {
          "zoom": [
            1,
            1.08
          ],
          "focus": [
            0.4,
            0.45
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chapter",
      "say": "Your brain treats a doorway like the end of a chapter. Old scene: *filed away.*",
      "visual": {
        "type": "split",
        "panels": [
          {
            "label": "OLD ROOM",
            "setting": "room",
            "props": [
              {
                "type": "couch",
                "x": 0.68
              },
              {
                "type": "lamp",
                "x": 0.92
              }
            ],
            "people": [
              {
                "x": 0.28,
                "face": "smile",
                "bubble": {
                  "text": "grab my keys!",
                  "kind": "thought",
                  "at": 0.2,
                  "side": "right"
                }
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              {
                "kind": "cross",
                "target": "all",
                "at": "filed",
                "label": "FILED AWAY"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "NEW ROOM",
            "at": "end",
            "setting": "room",
            "props": [
              {
                "type": "fridge",
                "x": 0.75
              }
            ],
            "people": [
              {
                "x": 0.35,
                "pose": "shrug",
                "face": "confused",
                "emote": "?",
                "emoteAt": "chapter"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "say": "Psychologists call it the *doorway effect.*",
      "visual": {
        "type": "quote",
        "text": "THE DOORWAY EFFECT",
        "sub": "Radvansky et al., 2011",
        "person": {
          "pose": "think",
          "face": "smug"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "tone": "deep",
      "say": "So you're not losing your mind. Your brain is just making room for what's next...",
      "visual": {
        "type": "situation",
        "setting": "rooftop",
        "people": [
          {
            "x": 0.2,
            "pose": "hug-knees",
            "look": "hoodie",
            "face": "meh",
            "gaze": 0.6,
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "making",
                "face": "smile"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "x": 0.5,
            "pose": "stand",
            "face": "smile",
            "gaze": 0.5,
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "brain",
                "pose": "point",
                "face": "smile"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "camera": {
          "zoom": [
            1.04,
            1
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "callback",
      "tone": "funny",
      "say": "even if what's next is the fridge. *Again.*",
      "visual": {
        "type": "situation",
        "setting": "room",
        "props": [
          {
            "type": "fridge",
            "x": 0.72,
            "open": "fridge"
          }
        ],
        "people": [
          {
            "x": 0.3,
            "pose": "cross",
            "face": "meh",
            "gaze": 0.9,
            "then": [
              {
                "at": "again",
                "pose": "facepalm",
                "face": "sad"
              }
            ],
            "emote": "sweat",
            "emoteAt": "again"
          }
        ],
        "camera": {
          "zoom": [
            1,
            1.12
          ],
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
